-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.7-14">oPort
-  .aMediaType                     This object is a function of the
-                                  Physical Media Dependent (PMD)
-                                  layer, which is defined
-                                  differently for each type of
-                                  network. For an 802.3 network,
